### 1. 1件登録する
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "category": "マーケティング",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01"
}

### 2. 1件取得する
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1

### 3. 1件更新する
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "競合サイトを5つ調べる",
  "detail": "比較表も作成する",
  "category": "マーケティング",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01",
  "completed": false
}

### 4. 1件削除する
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos/17

### 追加
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos?category=就職活動

### 5. 祝日を直接取ってくる
GET https://holidays-jp.github.io/api/v1/date.json

### 6. 自分のアプリの祝日API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/holidays

GET https://localhost:8080/api/todos?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-04-30

### 7. 履歴書を見直す
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "履歴書を見直す",
  "category": "就職活動",
  "priority": 1,
  "dueDate": "2026-04-04"
}

